<BaseLayout title="For App Users | The Roadside Emporium">
  <div class="benefits-individual-section">
    <div class="benefits-individual-item">
      <h3>Discover Unique Roadside Stands</h3>
      <p>Explore a variety of roadside stands and find hidden gems near you. Uncover hidden treasures and one-of-a-kind items that you won't find elsewhere. Experience the joy of stumbling upon delightful surprises as you venture off the beaten path.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="benefits-individual-item">
      <h3>Support Local Vendors</h3>
      <p>Contribute to the local economy and support small businesses in your community. Every purchase made supports local artisans and entrepreneurs, helping to sustain their livelihoods and keep the community thriving.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="benefits-individual-item">
      <h3>Find Fresh and Handmade Products</h3>
      <p>Discover fresh produce, handmade crafts, and locally sourced goods. From farm-fresh fruits and vegetables to handcrafted artwork, you can trust the quality and authenticity of the products you find at roadside stands. Embrace the charm of buying directly from the producers and artisans.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="benefits-individual-item">
      <h3>Plan Your Roadside Adventures</h3>
      <p>Plan your next roadside adventure with ease and never miss out on the best roadside stands. Our app provides comprehensive information about stand locations, operating hours, and special offerings. Create a personalized itinerary, navigate effortlessly, and make the most of your road trips.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
